  clock: 4  # d8a5
  nonce: d8a5  # d8a5
  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/iobcat2/). VERDICT: PARTLY-STALE. Re-checked 2026-11-01 at dev 100b6fbb6e. The gate cleared: stable_id v9 (94de74b194, 10-13) and v10 (ad925ef6d5, 10-22) shipped; scheme is now v13. Swift receiver-variable fallback is gone (INV-kotob satisfied; swift.py ~2970 writes external type / import alias / nothing); objc project-class slot fixed by WI-dason (done). cpp disjunction was ruled by the owner 2026-10-23 and shipped as a module-set handle + side table (INV-jahuf, 17cd29d60f, v12). Left: bash.py:1587-1589 still writes module_path='redirect', name=operator; 'external' sentinel unchanged; re-measure still needed. MECHANISM: analyzers write non-identity notions (sentinel, disjunction) into ExternalRef.module_path, which is part of the external_symbol id. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-jokij."  # d8a5
